  "id": "USN-8364-1",
  "summary": "libcommons-lang-java, libcommons-lang3-java vulnerability",
  "details": "It was discovered that Apache Commons Lang incorrectly handled recursion\nin the ClassUtils.getClass method. An attacker could possibly use this\nissue to cause Apache Commons Lang to crash, resulting in a denial of\nservice.",
